# Event Target Documentation
### province_definition
Unknown, add something in code registration
Input Scopes: location, colonial_charter, province
Output Scopes: province_definition

### advance_type
Unknown, add something in code registration
Requires Data: yes
Global Link: yes
Output Scopes: advance_type

### array_define
Reference the value of a numeric value in an array define: array_define:Namespace|Name|Index. Index is 0-based.
Requires Data: yes
Global Link: yes
Output Scopes: value
